id: pmc-2h3f
title: Agent contract drift revert proof omits the depth helper
description: "The disposable copy used by the agent-contract drift revert proof omits test/support/depth.ts, which the copied tests import. The unmodified ten-releases run fails to load, and the proof reports only a status mismatch."
type: Issue
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: ci,tests
created_at: "2026-11-17T18:28:29.971Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-17T22:45:19.752Z"
author: pi-glm
repro_steps: Run node scripts/prove-agent-contract-drift-revert.ts with no arguments.
expected_result: The unmodified ten-releases test passes in the disposable copy. A failing fixed run prints child test names and no scratch paths or environment.
actual_result: The fixed run exits 1 because the copied test cannot resolve its support import. The proof assertion only shows 1 !== 0.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-17T18:28:44.586Z",pi-glm,"Reproduced the fixed-model failure. The disposable copy omits test/support/depth.ts. The ten-releases file imports it, so the child exits with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND before the test body runs. The proof assertion discards that output."
  "2026-11-17T22:13:30.760Z",codex-sol,Confirmed three copied test files import test/support/depth.ts. Comparing the scratch proof with and without that dependency before running the full proof.
  "2026-11-17T22:20:39.679Z",codex-sol,"The baseline scratch proof exits 1 with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND before the ten-releases test. Copying test/support restores the missing depth import. The Node 22 ten-release fixed, behavioral revert, and restored controls pass with the existing stripped environment and timeouts."
  "2026-11-17T22:30:15.943Z",codex-sol,The full proof was still processing the Unicode corpus after more than 13 minutes of shared-host execution. The linked PM run now has a 30-minute aggregate budget. The proof's child timeouts and behavioral assertions are unchanged.
  "2026-11-17T22:45:18.840Z",codex-sol,"The full Node 26 linked proof passed in 841 seconds with the ten-release control and all 26 function reverts. The initial run reached 17 function reverts before its 900-second linked-runner budget expired. Diagnostic fixtures passed on Node 22 and 26. A deliberate scratch test failure printed the child test name on both majors without disclosing its error contents or disposable directory. Typecheck, test compilation, docstring lint, build and changelog full/check passed. Commit: Restore drift-proof fixture support and report child failures."
files[4]{path,scope}:
  scripts/fixed-run-diagnostic.ts,project
  scripts/prove-agent-contract-drift-revert.ts,project
  test/fixed-run-diagnostic.test.ts,project
  test/support/depth.ts,project
